# CR2. A1 AND A2 subseteq B -- the self-join rule.
# Expect: gate clean; entails C subseteq B for any C under both conjuncts.

@prefix :    <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:A1 a owl:Class . :A2 a owl:Class . :B a owl:Class . :C a owl:Class .
:C rdfs:subClassOf :A1, :A2 .
[ a owl:Class ; owl:intersectionOf ( :A1 :A2 ) ] rdfs:subClassOf :B .
